# Generated by hangar: glTF x = -y, y = up, z = forward (nose); origin at the CG.
forward -y
up +z
scale 1.0
# lifting surfaces, right half, root to tip: <kind> then per section its leading edge (body axes from the origin, m) and chord
wing 1.1600 0.0000 0.2500 3.0600 1.0700 2.9900 0.2500 2.9700 0.5030 8.5000 -0.4270 2.0710 0.1600 8.6200 -0.2500 1.6600
# jet engines by index: <bypass ratio> <afterburner 0|1>
engine 0 6.200 0
engine 1 6.200 0
# store stations: <number> <x> <y> <z> (a store's CG, body axes from the origin, m) <its bay: 0 none>
station 1 -0.2650 -6.8960 0.3700 0
station 2 -0.2060 -5.3160 0.5640 0
station 3 -0.1460 -3.7350 0.7580 0
station 4 -0.1030 -2.1550 0.8500 0
station 5 -0.0000 -0.6000 1.0000 0
station 6 -0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0
station 7 -0.0000 0.6000 1.0000 0
station 8 -0.1030 2.1550 0.8500 0
station 9 -0.1460 3.7350 0.7580 0
station 10 -0.2060 5.3160 0.5640 0
station 11 -0.2650 6.8960 0.3700 0
